---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="하자(Haja) 언어">
  <div class="py-20 flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
    <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter leading-tight text-black">
      한국어로 시작하는<br />
      <span class="text-zinc-400">객체지향 프로그래밍 언어</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mt-4 font-light">
      영어를 몰라도 누구나 쉽게 코드를 읽고 쓸 수 있어요.<br />
      자연스러운 우리말로 프로그래밍을 시작해 보세요.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-8">
      <a href="/docs/intro" class="bg-black text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors">
        시작하기
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/tutorial/1-variables" class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-zinc-800 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-zinc-50 transition-colors">
        문법 살펴보기
      </a>
      <a href="/playground" class="bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 border border-blue-200 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-blue-100 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
        놀이터 열기
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
